  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.5.0:\n- Enum-based SQL column type system: SqlColumnType, ColumnTypeFacets, CLR-type inference, and PropertyBuilder.HasColumnType(...). Dialects resolve types via ISqlDialect.GetColumnTypeSql.\n- Session temp tables without raw DDL: DapperDbContext.TempTable(name) fluent builder, CreateTempTableFromAsync(DataTable), and DapperSet.CreateTempTableLikeAsync (mirror an entity).\n- Bulk copy API: DapperSet.BulkCopyAsync (entity-driven) and DapperDbContext.BulkCopyAsync (DataTable-driven) via the IBulkCopyExecutor capability. SQLite uses a batched parameterized-insert fallback; SqlBulkCopy stays out of Core.\n\nv2.2.0:\n- BulkInsertAsync and BulkMergeAsync with automatic per-dialect batching.\n- Include/ThenInclude now accept a Where filter predicate.",
